                  <provenance type="MLGB3_laterOwners">Oxford, Bodleian Library, MS Twyne XXI, p.
                     264 contains notes made by Brian Twyne <q>ex manuscripto episcopi Oxon'
                           [<persName role="fmo">John Bridges</persName>, Bishop of Oxford
                        1604-1618] apud Staunton Harcot in folio...</q>. This was the last known
                     provenance according to the supplement to Medieval Libraries of Great Britain
                     (1987). The book remains untraced.</provenance>
